        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/a144b85a4388b8ded87d69629300e640.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// <strong>PREMISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a low level delivery goon for a shady research company running what should've been a simple drop off. But the &quot;intel&quot; in your bag? It's actually a module for building evil robots. And thanks to your incompetence, you've just been captured by rebels trying to steal it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/ce43ef30c928b2d752279cadd3ea9e7a.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/ce43ef30c928b2d752279cadd3ea9e7a.webp?t=1787344315 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... now they’re dead set on cracking open your mind until you spill everything they want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/a6e2f4ba9d17b590d8c6f98466723d65.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// YOUR DESKTOP COMPANION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BBY DON'T HURT ME</strong> is a furry interactive desktop companion that sits on your screen’s edge and delivers insulting remarks as you work or browse. They want to break you. They want control. And they’ll smile while doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Customizable <strong>voice commands</strong> to open websites, applications and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Featuring 4 fully animated base characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  8 unlockable reskins (unlocked after love ending / toast ending is achieved)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  4 unique mini games to play with instead of working</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  <strong>Feet size slider</strong> to stomp and break glass in desktop mode​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  5 special guest stars featuring <strong>Bardic, Joseph AK, RaealTV, DatKawaiiWolfy, JTWusky</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Interactable body bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.poster.avif?t=1787344315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.webm?t=1787344315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.mp4?t=1787344315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/0e6b18ba3fead40f544e94a56ad0bcb9.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=303 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// STAR VOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four fully animated personalities with three degrees of burn: Sweet, Sour, and Spicy. Includes over<strong> 500+ voicelines. </strong>Delivered to you by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Vera Tan // Havoc (Shark)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Nola Klop // Octavic (Fox)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Michael Kovach // Waveform (Poodle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Max Herzfeld // Litany (Wolf)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/e825654346d1b5127df3162cae2bf056.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/e825654346d1b5127df3162cae2bf056.webp?t=1787344315 width=1600 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/03ddd9e68b7f59fbfc0179554d4ed953.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/03ddd9e68b7f59fbfc0179554d4ed953.webp?t=1787344315 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/82ccd173893ed524e367467a45c85772.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// MODDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who wouldn’t want to bring their own OC to life in a game? <strong>BBY DON’T HURT ME</strong> makes it easy for streamers and users with Live2D support. It also comes with a simple level editor so users wont need to touch the codebase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload a .csv of custom voicelines and pair them with your own audio recordings to give your character a real voice in game. View and share mods on our community Discord!<br><br>🐾 Discord Link:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/1d4b46af094f8197cfd7ea52ab66e100.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/1d4b46af094f8197cfd7ea52ab66e100.webp?t=1787344315 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/4f7a362cb1c411ded5b90a53639cde33.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/4f7a362cb1c411ded5b90a53639cde33.webp?t=1787344315 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/a144b85a4388b8ded87d69629300e640.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// <strong>PREMISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a low level delivery goon for a shady research company running what should've been a simple drop off. But the &quot;intel&quot; in your bag? It's actually a module for building evil robots. And thanks to your incompetence, you've just been captured by rebels trying to steal it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/ce43ef30c928b2d752279cadd3ea9e7a.avif?t=1787344315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras_big/ce43ef30c928b2d752279cadd3ea9e7a.webp?t=1787344315 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... now they’re dead set on cracking open your mind until you spill everything they want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/a6e2f4ba9d17b590d8c6f98466723d65.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// YOUR DESKTOP COMPANION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BBY DON'T HURT ME</strong> is a furry interactive desktop companion that sits on your screen’s edge and delivers insulting remarks as you work or browse. They want to break you. They want control. And they’ll smile while doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Customizable <strong>voice commands</strong> to open websites, applications and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Featuring 4 fully animated base characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  8 unlockable reskins (unlocked after love ending / toast ending is achieved)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  4 unique mini games to play with instead of working</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  <strong>Feet size slider</strong> to stomp and break glass in desktop mode​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  5 special guest stars featuring <strong>Bardic, Joseph AK, RaealTV, DatKawaiiWolfy, JTWusky</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾  Interactable body bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.poster.avif?t=1787344315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.webm?t=1787344315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/2556b5635e3a17e107407f8ee28072f4.mp4?t=1787344315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/0e6b18ba3fead40f544e94a56ad0bcb9.avif?t=1787344315\" width=615 height=303 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// STAR VOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four fully animated personalities with three degrees of burn: Sweet, Sour, and Spicy. Includes over<strong> 500+ voicelines. </strong>Delivered to you by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Vera Tan // Havoc (Shark)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Nola Klop // Octavic (Fox)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Michael Kovach // Waveform (Poodle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Max Herzfeld // Litany (Wolf)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://